# Ignore the build folder specifically inside the Amrex directory
**/Amrex/build/

# Or, if you want to ignore ANY build directory anywhere in the project, just use:
 build/

# --- CMake / C++ Artifacts ---
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/Makefile
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/install/
*.o
*.a
*.so

# --- AMReX Output Files ---
# Ignores plotfiles and checkpoint directories generated by AMReX
plt*/
chk*/
*.vtm
*.vtu

# --- Euler Cluster Batch Outputs ---
# Ignores LSF or Slurm job output files generated on Euler
lsf.o*
slurm-*.out

# --- Python & macOS Junk ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
